        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00014">
          <para id="para-00070">Compare your answer:</para>

          <para id="para-00071">\(6y+z=-4\)</para>

          <para id="para-00072">Solve the system of your two new equations, then answer questions 3 and 4.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
